, "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391785_1193063012568188_2265459248747162137_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pu96YSsUyMEQ7kNvwF9-nIe&_nc_oc=Adq30X3w5ExftWwvq8-HfgYbqAgvLikFCkPd8J5sGe9J6O0lFBObiUBosjMUYaB5Nyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB4rDPrwAky8Qwp10UcTBsrg6fKgRCLlfCC8U6BvhMWCg&oe=6A4FB254"}, {"file_name": "17-1440.png", "id": "1619638305613230", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001733_1619638308946563_3828887439833949376_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8F8bhb9TJG4Q7kNvwEhy5bz&_nc_oc=Adp0umZsb7pW3MEGxDMrEuVExOjtNMvcVCusZkDLN8KCS3nnrRygDx234WHwzmrJz74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAACl8g4sm_3bV0kBxfzEc1Le1W-YquMN-Epn4MsQoOaQ&oe=6A4F9D5A"}, {"file_name": "21-1440.png", "id": "1060654858865138", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031414_1060654862198471_822572205668500382_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1D15293OiQsQ7kNvwG6iPSW&_nc_oc=AdqWwnREmqtxcp4UStEy5BZYYfvRow4n2aygUp7KM4rr3kvdmAhx8E6x202P-LdV3Gc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAxVa6G2E5lfoNxA0f6TjuEHO_Z0Bi2HNQSEgwOk5Solw&oe=6A4FA180"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "COVER LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "2393787781129851", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311582_2393787787796517_311857628796633326_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C8ea0wM0U9IQ7kNvwFvy6kd&_nc_oc=AdpqfBJGYwtrrUy_dJwwpzhHUmrR_QM8Ss9ptw_7KcCXfgfNQ4gLPcmmOQVftS3_yBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBtkenuW910M5dTaJJGeJKpRcX8BoSsBoVzL1QQnEt9PQ&oe=6A4F9CC0"}, "display_name": "HARD BULLET", "keywords": ["Action", "Shooter", "Physics", "Sandbox", "Destruction"], "long_description": "# Welcome to the world of HARD BULLET.\n\nPrepare for **brutal and destructive** combat where imagination is your weapon. HARD BULLET offers immersive action with endless enemies in **RIDE Mode**, custom rules in **Sandbox Mode**, and skill tests in the **Arena**.\n\n**Your path to brutal glory is about to begin.**\n\n# Slow Motion and Tricks\nControl time, perform slow-motion jumps, leg kicks, dual-wield guns, and deliver powerful punches.\n{1363437721738155}\n\n# Fast-paced Action\nInspired by classic Hong Kong action movies, bringing high-energy mature combat to your VR headset.\n{1472191853800067}\n\n# Physical Interactions\nDisarm enemies, steal weapons, use leg kick, and perform one-handed reloads with our innovative physics setup.\n{593339603533723}\n\n# Weapons\nOver 100 iconic pistols, submachine guns, shotguns, and rifles, all beautifully crafted with custom skins and a collection of melee.\n{1836682263859554}\n\n# Progression\nDive into RIDE runs to gain experience & unlockables!\n{1116850786785819}\n\n# Sandbox & Arena\nUse the ammo workshop, giant generator, and welding machine to build your own crazy weapons in this creative mode. \n{3597752887187720}\n\n- **Welding Tool:** Combine any in-game objects into one! Create custom weapons, machines, or monsters using guns, props, and even enemies.\n- **Enemy Customization:** Create a giant you can climb up or dwarves, immortal zombies, or just change their fancy outfits!\n- **Spawner Tool:** Spawn any objects, anywhere, it's your playground!", "short_description": "HARD BULLET is a physics-based action game, where enemies flood the neon-lit city bringing destruction to its streets. Use slow-motion, a huge arsenal, and brutal combat to survive and unlock new weapons. Prepare for the next RIDE by mastering your skills in Sandbox and Arena modes."}]}, "developer_name": "GexagonVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gexagon.com/hard-bullet-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GexagonVR", "support_website_url": "https://gexagon.com/contact-en/", "website_url": "https://gexagon.com/", "categ